Mario Kart Wii for PS Vita: licensing notice
============================================

This is a PS Vita port of MiniBandit's MKW-3DS. The notices below for the
original port and the continuation apply unchanged; the Vita layer
(platform/vita, tools/vita) and the port's changes follow the same MIT terms.

The original port
-----------------
This project continues the Mario Kart Wii 3DS port and CIA builder written by
dudewhat. dudewhat released its source publicly (mkw-3ds-cia-builder v0.1.0)
without an explicit license. That code is imported unchanged in the first
commit of this repository and remains dudewhat's; it is credited here and is
not covered by this repository's LICENSE. If you are dudewhat and want
something changed, please open an issue.

This continuation
-----------------
MiniBandit's changes and additions (every commit after the import) are
